{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"t":"Reading","c":1,"x":0.81935174636286623,"y":0.036192718861185469,"w":0.085568351745605509,"h":0.022091306407132305},{"t":"Questions 34-40","y":0.088662790547511472,"w":0.18252427419026696,"x":0.067961163779719835,"h":0.021929109282211368,"c":1},{"h":0.023364485981308358,"w":0.29126213073730467,"c":1,"y":0.12492211848344403,"t":"Complete the summary below.","x":0.067961168393483581},{"h":0.0218403611227731,"y":0.16133720915899996,"t":"Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.","x":0.069902922183372032,"w":0.59611648559570318,"c":1},{"h":0.021864812025028546,"x":0.069902918547102594,"w":0.55145629882812497,"c":1,"t":"Write your answers in boxes 34-40 on your answer sheet.","y":0.19906542066339517},{"c":1,"h":0.023364485981308358,"x":0.28543689454699706,"w":0.40970873514811201,"t":"Leonardo da Vinci's ideal city","y":0.25576323964382008},{"t":"A collection of Leonardo da Vinci's paperwork reveals his design of a new city","h":0.024773942941445859,"w":0.73228729248046875,"c":1,"y":0.30037687590417539,"x":0.091150735505072092},{"h":0.021931086745217598,"c":1,"t":"beside the Ticino River. This was to provide better 34...","w":0.51667429606119797,"x":0.091171129348799271,"y":0.32668865700222705},{"t":"...for trade","x":0.75108734446535852,"y":0.32446210983486123,"w":0.097825311024983708,"h":0.021133918405693231,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.091262133312413687,"y":0.3531976743013493,"t":"and a less polluted environment. Although Leonardo da Vinci's city shared many of","h":0.017518836761189482,"w":0.78058252970377595},{"t":"the ideals of his time, some of his innovations were considered unconventional in","y":0.3772230373252865,"w":0.76325037638346349,"c":1,"x":0.091193919313331734,"h":0.020177706899672687},{"t":"their design. They included features that can be seen in some tower blocks today,","c":1,"x":0.091262139672756648,"w":0.76893203735351567,"y":0.40116279073784988,"h":0.0188953482844747},{"x":0.093203882191267642,"c":1,"y":0.4286604359366688,"t":"such as 35 ...","h":0.014653517226935087,"w":0.1184466044108073},{"t":"... on the exterior of a building.","y":0.42732558147897215,"x":0.35728155941860584,"w":0.27961163838704428,"h":0.015988371899566256,"c":1},{"y":0.46867830816265243,"h":0.020124156155690298,"t":"Leonardo da Vinci wasn't only an architect. His expertise in 36","w":0.58661366780598967,"x":0.091181648009599311,"c":1},{"w":0.74968994140625,"y":0.49306585750998533,"x":0.093119479062529625,"t":"was evident in his plans for artificial canals within his ideal city. He also believed","c":1,"h":0.019235531934696626},{"c":1,"h":0.019665021094206314,"y":0.51696379185391039,"w":0.76710520426432283,"t":"that the height of houses should relate to the width of streets in case earthquakes","x":0.09120426384214142},{"x":0.093203873786411817,"t":"occurred. The design of many cities in Italy today follows this 37","w":0.60388351440429677,"h":0.017454538909817074,"y":0.54360465104886357,"c":1},{"w":0.2563106791178385,"h":0.014659856635833468,"c":1,"x":0.093203883641017601,"t":"While some cities from 38 ..","y":0.58720930202948729},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"x":0.50873786854603131,"c":1,"w":0.34174756368001302,"t":"times have aspects that can also be","y":0.58566978192670571},{"h":0.022066428876740152,"w":0.76710530598958315,"x":0.09119954810129012,"y":0.60855656615256448,"t":"found in Leonardo's designs, his ideas weren't put into practice until long after his","c":1},{"w":0.10303972880045573,"h":0.016451024563513106,"c":1,"y":0.63639658072422967,"x":0.093140329664356425,"t":"death. 39 .."},{"c":1,"t":".. is one example of a city that was redesigned in the","w":0.48932037353515628,"x":0.34563107527044773,"y":0.6351744186980488,"h":0.015988371899566145},{"w":0.78658376057942703,"x":0.093123604013189074,"y":0.65721129544750689,"t":"19th century in the way that Leonardo had envisaged. His ideas are also relevant to","h":0.020575157949857648,"c":1},{"x":0.091262134605649359,"t":"today's world, where building 40..","w":0.3184466044108073,"h":0.017587662337353649,"y":0.68459302313855863,"c":1},{"h":0.019195988616467985,"x":0.55510876878473958,"c":1,"y":0.68214727202727643,"t":"... no longer seems to be the best","w":0.311137949625651},{"h":0.018263845948786717,"c":1,"x":0.092896902079235316,"t":"approach.","y":0.70816458847110064,"w":0.099643090565999348},{"c":1,"w":0.021359222730000793,"x":0.72427184486477303,"h":0.017441860686210009,"y":0.95494186020922067,"t":"→"},{"h":0.015654641742646969,"y":0.95664086211888733,"x":0.76102058741451417,"t":"• p. 122","c":1,"w":0.091702677408854183},{"y":0.95348837190319513,"c":1,"h":0.017441860686210009,"x":0.88155339730421078,"w":0.02718446731567381,"t":"51"}]}